yle-ref="21"><span data-b13-style-ref="47"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-23" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesExtraordinaryItemsNoncontrollingInterest" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1197">3,378</ix:nonFraction></span><span data-b13-style-ref="46">&#160;</span></td><td data-b13-style-ref="22"/><td colspan="3" style="display:none"/></tr></table></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt"><span data-b13-style-ref="43">Revenues attributed to operations located outside the U.S. were</span><span data-b13-style-ref="44"> </span><span data-b13-style-ref="43">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-273" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:Revenues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1198">5,672</ix:nonFraction> million in 2025, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-274" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:Revenues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1199">5,512</ix:nonFraction> million in 2024, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-275" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:Revenues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1200">5,160</ix:nonFraction> million in 2023, including cost reimbursement revenue outside the U.S. of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-276" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:Revenues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1201">3,077</ix:nonFraction> million in 2025, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-277" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:Revenues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1202">3,018</ix:nonFraction> million in 2024, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-278" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:Revenues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1203">2,806</ix:nonFraction> million in 2023.</span></div><div style="margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt"><span data-b13-style-ref="43">Segment profits attributed to operations located outside the U.S. were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-273" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1204">1,382</ix:nonFraction> million in 2025, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-274" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1205">1,329</ix:nonFraction> million in 2024, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-275" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-1206">1,258</ix:nonFraction> million in 2023, including cost reimbursements, net (cost reimbursement revenue, net of reimbursed expenses) outside the U.S. of $(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-279" decimals="-6" sign="-" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" scale="6" id="f-1207">54</ix:nonFraction>) million in 2025, $(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-280" decimals="-6" sign="-" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" scale="6" id="f-1208">55</ix:nonFraction>) million in 2024, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-281" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss" scale="6" id="f-1209">23</ix:nonFraction> million in 2023.</span></div></ix:continuation>